<title>UK: Gowrings expands Burger King chain.</title>
<headline>Gowrings expands Burger King chain.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britan's Gowrings Plc Plc said it was opening five new Burger King restaurants in Britain which would create 300 new jobs.</p>
<p>Gowrings' Burger King restaurant network would then have 21 outlets.</p>
<p>Its 16 other restaurants are spread throughout the south and south west of England. The company also has dealerships for Ford in Newbury and Workingham.</p>
<p>Gowrings said its new Burger King shops will be in Newton Abbot, Newbury, Bournemouth, Birmingham and Southampton.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
